flowchart TB
    Agent["Coding agent: Codex or Claude Code"] -->|candidate patch| Worktree["Isolated worktree"]
    Worktree --> Runtime["Reproducible application runtime"]
    Runner["Controlled benchmark runner"] -->|registered workload| Runtime
    Runtime --> Collector["OpenTelemetry Collector"]
    Collector --> Stores["Tempo: traces / Prometheus: metrics / Loki: sanitized logs"]
    Runtime --> Profiler["Bounded profiler"]
    Profiler --> Pyroscope["Pyroscope or profile artifacts"]
    Stores --> Evidence["Read-only Agent Evidence Interface"]
    Pyroscope --> Evidence
    Source["Build manifest and source index"] --> Evidence
    Evidence -->|measurements, hypotheses, gaps| Agent
    Worktree -->|candidate revision| Verifier["Independent verifier: protected contract"]
    Runner --> Artifacts["Immutable benchmark artifacts"]
    Artifacts --> Verifier
    Verifier -->|accept, revise, or revert| Agent
